;    1: TDecorate(count=194, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=1407, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=111, unk2=8453888, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=13, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1969, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1742, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ろうそく.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Next is <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE>. Give us your very best one."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Leave it to me! I've got a special one saved up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">By then I had long since forgotten my anger at </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ろうそくの明かり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Actually, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">my sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has a bit of a sense for the supernatural. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But she and I aren't very close. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If anything, she's got a bit of a delinquent side, the type who goes out partying night after night..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s story seemed to be a proper ghost story.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―It was while I was facing my high-school entrance exams... let's see, 3 months ago from now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">As I was about to leave for my cram school, which started at 18:00, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was in the living room, which was unusual.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you're home..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Unfriendly as always, as if she couldn't hear what I said.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She must be ignoring me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> going out now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm asking if you're going out."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was the first time we'd talked in a long while, so it threw me, but:</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, to cram school..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> don't call anyone. Something feels bad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Bad?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"The other kind."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> answered like that, still watching TV.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, I'll be careful."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If she went out of her way to warn me, it had to be something serious.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But what did she mean, I mustn't make calls?</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">It was very cold outside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it, the forecast said it would snow tonight.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\和の廃墟.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雪.wmv" "358" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\雪道1.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">―Cram school ended around 21:00.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, snow..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A night brighter than usual.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was the piled-up snow, reflecting the streetlights.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The cram-school kids started playing, throwing the piled-up snow and making snowmen.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I was pretty excited about the snow too, but even so, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s warning kept bothering me...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I left cram school in a hurry.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">The snowy roads were too dangerous to ride my bike home on, so I left the bike at cram school and walked back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow2.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="2">As I walked, the snow piled up even more.</STYLE><PG>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\雪道2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">When I turned into a narrow alley, I sensed someone behind me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\dark_attack.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\雪道3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I looked back, but no one was there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Well, probably just my imagination.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'm just a little on edge because of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s warning.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\雪道2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">But why?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe it was because this was a road I usually took by bike and hardly ever walked, but I still sensed someone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The presence I sensed was about 100 meters behind me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">100 meters behind... that's a bit too far to sense anyone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">When I tried walking without making a sound with my feet...</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow1.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">With every step I took, the presence came a little closer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Was this really just my imagination?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Or did it have something to do with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s warning...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Home was still more than 30 minutes away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even I was starting to get scared of walking alone.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Should I get my parents to pick me up in the car?</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "0" "1000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I took out my phone, and as I was about to press the button, I remembered </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s words.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―Don't make any calls.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I put my phone back in my pocket.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What if not just calls but messages were off-limits too...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\雪道3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">When I looked back, there was still no one.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There was only a thin cherry tree, and nowhere anyone could really hide.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But the presence still hadn't gone away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\雪道2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow2早い.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">That's when I got really scared and broke into a run over the bad road.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow1早い.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">But the presence didn't fall behind. It kept following me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Steadily... and matching my speed... closing in...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">What do I do, what do I do...! At this rate it'll catch up before I get home...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What would happen to me if it caught up?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Something invisible was steadily chasing me...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I shoved my freezing hands into my pockets, hunched my shoulders, and moved my feet fast.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Soon I was getting out of breath, and the clouds of white breath from my mouth blocked my view.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Losing my view made me panic more, my feet went faster, and I got even more out of breath: a vicious circle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Because my sight was being taken from me, my other senses grew sharper.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">My sense for presences grew sharper and stirred up my fear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I was so panicked that if there had been a cliff 1 meter ahead, I think I would have gone right over it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The feel of the cold phone, sensed through the hand stuffed in my pocket.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But I couldn't use it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">That's it! I'll walk while pretending to be on the phone!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That way I'm not really using the phone, and I can make whoever it is wary too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I slowed down, caught my breath, and took out the cold phone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And then I held it to my ear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\haa1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hah... hah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hello? Where are you right now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I talked into a phone that wasn't connected to anyone.</STYLE><PG>
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "0" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------